WEBVTT

NOTE
English audio description for this app's excerpt of the film, written for this app (read aloud by the
browser's speech synthesis when Audio description is on). Times follow the gaps in the dialogue.

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.700
Title: Elephants Dream, on a tiled green wall that fades to dark.

2
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.700
A vast machine of cables and metal. An old man hurries along a narrow ledge, a young man close behind.

3
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.500
Mist rises around them as the ledge shakes.

4
00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.800
The young man, Emo, looks up, shaken.

5
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.800
The old man brushes himself off.

6
00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:58.400
They head toward a towering metal door.
